 "title": "200 V N-channel OptiMOS 3 power MOSFET in PG-TDSON-8",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev. 2.4, 2022-11-09",
  "pages": 11
 },
 "summary": "A single N-channel, normal-level power MOSFET of the OptiMOS 3 family, in the leadless PG-TDSON-8 with a drain pad underneath. It blocks 200 V and carries 36 A continuously with the case at 25 °C (144 A pulsed); on-resistance is 32 mΩ max (27 mΩ typ) at 10 V on the gate. Total gate charge is 22 nC typ, and the product of gate charge and on-resistance (its figure of merit) is low; the part suits synchronous rectification and high-frequency switching. Lead plating is lead-free, the part is RoHS compliant and halogen-free to IEC 61249-2-21, and it is qualified to JEDEC (J-STD20 and JESD22) for its target application.",
